        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Bag 18:3—19:37; Isa 36:1—37:38.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hezekia ku yaaherize kukora ebyo n'okworeka obwesigwa bwe, Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria yaija yaateera Yuda, yaateera orusiisira kurwanisa endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, naateekateeka ngu naija kuzeekubuurira zoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia ku yaareebire Senakeribu yaija amaririire kuteera Yerusaalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaahanuura n'abakuru b'engabo ze n'abashaija be ab'amaani kwita enshuro ezaabaire ziri enyima y'orurembo; baamuhwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baingi munonga baateerana, baita enshuro zoona, n'akagyera akaabaire nikaraba omuri egyo nsi, ahakuba bakagira bati: Ebyo nikwo kwona Abaasiria baije, bashangye egi amaizi maingi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.25.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 25:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaayezirika kukora, yaayombeka busya orugo rw'amabaare orwakumbagaziibwe, yaarwombekaho eminaara, kandi enyima yaarwo yaayombekayo orundi rugo, yaahamya Miilo omu rurembo rwa Daudi. Kandi yaaheesesa eby'okurwanisa n'engabo bingi munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaataho abakuru b'engabo kutegyeka abantu, yaabateeranira ah'ari omu kubuga eky'aha irembo ry'orurembo, yaabagambira ebigambo by'okubagumya, naagira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 20:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 31:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mube ab'amaani, mugume; mutatiina, kandi mutahahaaza emitima ahabw'omugabe wa Asiria n'engabo ze nyingi ezi aine; ahabw'okuba ori hamwe naitwe naakira ori hamwe nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 15:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 17:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aha rubaju rwe aine emikono y'abantu-buntu, kwonka aha rubaju rwaitu twine MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu kutuhwera n'omkuturwanira engamba zaitu. Abantu baayesiga ebigambo bya Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima y'ebyo Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria, owaabaire agotsire Lakishi n'engabo ze zoona, yaatuma abagaragwa be Yerusaalemu ahari Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda n'aha bantu ba Yuda boona abaabaire bari Yerusaalemu, naagira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria arikugamba naagira ati: Mbwenu mwesigire ki okutegyereza kugoterwa omuri Yerusaalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia, orikubagira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu naija kutujuna omu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria, tarikubabeiha, ngu mwitwe enjara n'eiriho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia ogwo tiwe yaihireho emyanya ye mikuru ey'okuramizamu n'amatambiro, naaragiira Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu ati: Mushemereire kuguma nimuramiza omu masiho g'eitambiro rimwe ryonka, kandi n'okuritambiraho ebitambo byanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timurikumanya oku nyowe ana baatatenkuru twagizire abantu boona ab'omu gandi mahanga? Baaruhanga b'ago mahanga bakabaasa kujuna ensi zaabo omu mikono yangye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'oha omuri baaruhanga boona ab'ago mahanga agu baatatenkuru baacwekyerereize kimwe owaabasize kujuna abantu be omu mikono yangye, naimwe mukabona kwesiga ku Ruhanga waanyu arikwija kubakiza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo murekye kwikiriza Hezekia kubabeihabeiha n'okubahabya atyo, kandi murekye kumwesiga, ahabw'okuba tihariho ruhanga ow'eihanga ryona nari obugabe bwona orabaasize kujuna abantu be omu mikono yangye nari eya baatatenkuru, reero kaashwa Ruhanga waanyu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima abagaragwa be baayeyongyereraho ebindi bigambo baajuma Mukama RUHANGA n'omwiru we Hezekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Senakeribu yaahandiika ebaruha z'okugayisa MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli n'okumujuma, naagira ati: Nk'oku baaruhanga b'amahanga g'omu nsi batarajunire bantu baabo mu mikono yangye, nikwo na Ruhanga wa Hezekia atarikwija kujuna abe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bigambo baabigambira aba Yerusaalemu abaabaire bari aha rugo rw'amabaare n'eiraka rihango omu rurimi rw'Abayudaaya, ngu babatiinise, babahahaaze emitima, babone kukwata orurembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagamba ahari Ruhanga wa Yerusaalemu, nk'oku bagamba ahari baaruhanga b'ensi abakozirwe emikono y'abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo kyareetera Hezekia omugabe na Isaaya nabi mwene Amozi kushaba nibatakira eiguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaayohereza maraika, yaacwekyereza abarwani boona ab'amaani, n'abakuru b'amahe n'abakuru b'engabo abaabaire bari omu rusiisira rw'omugabe wa Asiria. Atyo yaagaruka omu nsi ye aine enshoni. Ku yaahikire omuri hekalu ya ruhanga we, abu yaayezaariire baamwitiramu na rurara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo MUKAMA yaajunire Hezekia n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaaklemu omu mikono ya Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria, n'omu mikono y'abandi bazigu be boona; bwanyima akabaha okuhuumura embaju zoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abantu baingi baareetera MUKAMA emitoijo Yerusaalemu, na Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda baamutoijera ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi; okwiha obwo kyamureetera okurangaanwa omu mahanga goona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
