          "text": " Kwonka Hezekia yaayecureeza, yaayeteisa amaryo g'omu mutima gwe, we n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu; na'ahabw'ekyo ekiniga kya MUKAMA tikyabaijaho omu busingye bwa Hezekia.",
