            {
              "text": "\n        Isa 36:1—39:8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Endiijo mirimo ya Hezekia n'ebirungi ebi yaakozire, reeba, bihandiikirwe omu bi nabi Isaaya mwene Amzi yaayorekirwe, n'omu kitabo ky'abagabe ba Yuda n'aba Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Hezekia yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa aha rubaju rwa ruguru rw'ebituuro bya batabani ba Daudi; aha kufa kwe Abayuda boona n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu baamuha ekitiinisa. Bwanyima omutabani Manaase yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.33"
            ]
          }
